  m_text: "That feverish night, you were certain \nit would be your last. But Baksy,
    our \ngrandmother, disagreed. Her herbs \nand strange remedies cured you \ncompletely.
    Ever since, you've kept \nsome of her herbs nearby, just in case \nthe fever
    decides to come back.\n<color=red> (Makes the lid sturdier.)</color>"
