  m_text: "Remember your first confession of \nlove? You failed so badly that nothing
    \ncould have saved the situation... except \na miracle. And somehow, one happened.
    \nYour uncle taught you to play the Kobyz, \nand your performance won her heart.
    A \nweek later she was carried off in a \ntraditional bride kidnapping anyway.\n<color=red>(Has
    a chance to return a soul that \nescaped the cauldron.)</color>"
