  m_text: "When it was time to travel to the \nsummer pastures, you secretly \ndrank
    your grandfather's Shubat. \nThe stomachache that followed left \nyou completely
    helpless. Grandfather \nonly laughed and handed you his \nTorsyk. He was unusually
    kind that day. \nYou were unusually slow.\n<color=red>(Has a chance to slow a
    soul inside the cauldron.)</color>"
